## **Learnings**
✅ **Using Dictionaries for Fast Lookup**  
Tracking word occurrences ensures efficient processing.

✅ **Palindrome Pairing Strategy**  
Directly pairing words with their reverses simplifies length calculations.

✅ **Handling Odd Frequency Cases**  
By placing one odd palindrome in the center, we optimize palindrome construction.
